## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Backend — Creator API Layer

---

#### [NEW] [creator.service.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/services/creator.service.js)

Service riêng cho Creator với đặc điểm:
- Mọi query CRUD **luôn filter** theo `CreatedByUserID = currentUserID`
- Hỗ trợ `ContentStatus` workflow: `Draft` → `PendingReview` → `Published` / `Rejected`
- Các method chính:
  - `getMyTopics(userId, filters)` — lấy topics do creator tạo
  - `createTopic(data, userId)` — tạo topic với `ContentStatus = 'Draft'`
  - `updateTopic(id, data, userId)` — sửa topic, check ownership
  - `deleteTopic(id, userId)` — xóa topic draft
  - `getMyWords(userId, filters)` — tương tự cho Words
  - `createWord(data, userId)`, `updateWord()`, `deleteWord()`
  - `getMyQuestions(userId)`, `createQuestion()`, `updateQuestion()`, `deleteQuestion()`
  - `getMyMiniTests(userId)`, `createMiniTest()`, `updateMiniTest()`, `deleteMiniTest()`
  - `submitForReview(entityType, entityId, userId)` — đổi status sang `PendingReview`, ghi `ContentReviewLogs`
  - `getDashboardStats(userId)` — dùng `vw_ContentCreatorContentSummary`
  - `getContentAnalytics(userId)` — join `vw_TopicLearningAnalytics`, `vw_MiniTestAnalytics`

#### [NEW] [creator.controller.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/controllers/creator.controller.js)

Controller delegate tới `CreatorService`, trả JSON response chuẩn.

#### [NEW] [creator.routes.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/routes/creator.routes.js)

Routes bảo vệ bởi `verifyToken` + `checkPermission(...)`:
```
GET    /api/creator/dashboard
GET    /api/creator/analytics

GET    /api/creator/topics
POST   /api/creator/topics
PUT    /api/creator/topics/:id
DELETE /api/creator/topics/:id
POST   /api/creator/topics/:id/submit-review

GET    /api/creator/words
POST   /api/creator/words
PUT    /api/creator/words/:id
DELETE /api/creator/words/:id
POST   /api/creator/words/:id/submit-review

GET    /api/creator/questions
POST   /api/creator/questions
PUT    /api/creator/questions/:id
DELETE /api/creator/questions/:id

GET    /api/creator/minitests
POST   /api/creator/minitests
PUT    /api/creator/minitests/:id
DELETE /api/creator/minitests/:id
POST   /api/creator/minitests/:id/submit-review
```

#### [MODIFY] [index.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/index.js)

Thêm `app.use('/api/creator', creatorRoutes);`

#### [NEW] [review.service.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/services/review.service.js)

Admin review service:
- `getPendingContent()` — lấy nội dung `PendingReview` trên mọi bảng
- `approveContent(entityType, entityId, adminId)` — đổi `Published`, ghi log
- `rejectContent(entityType, entityId, adminId, reason)` — đổi `Rejected`, ghi log + lý do

#### [NEW] [review.controller.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/controllers/review.controller.js)

#### [NEW] [review.routes.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/routes/review.routes.js)

```
GET  /api/admin/content-review/pending
POST /api/admin/content-review/:entityType/:entityId/approve
POST /api/admin/content-review/:entityType/:entityId/reject
```

#### [MODIFY] [admin.routes.js](file:///d:/Code/Project_Web_nam3_ky2/web_hoc_tu_vung/vocab-practice/backend/src/routes/admin.routes.js)

Mount review routes vào admin router.

